# Line-ending normalization (added 2026-10-30, see AUDIT-2026-10-30.md sec.2).
# The initial commit mixed CRLF/LF and the engine was later touched on Windows,
# producing ~850 phantom-CRLF "modified" files. Store LF, check out LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artifacts: never convert, never diff.
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.wasm binary
*.bin binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary

# Images
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp binary

# Fonts
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
